The MPL-2.0 applies to libplctag's own source files only. It does not apply to
this plugin's code, which remains under the Apache License 2.0. The library is
provided as a separate shared object so a recipient can replace it with another
build of the same release. The complete libplctag source for the bundled
version is available at the URL and commit above, and its license texts are in
the files LICENSE-1.MPL and LICENSE-2.LGPL of that repository.

Other dependencies (Fledge C++ SDK, RapidJSON headers) are provided by the
Fledge installation the plugin is built against and are not bundled.
